    {
      "id": 128016,
      "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
      "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-18T04:07:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It's tricky. &nbsp;Destruction effects happen again. &nbsp;BUT - cards under Savage Mana have no text (except for which deck they came from). &nbsp;So destruction effects on the cards themselves don't exist, and many other destruction effects (such as CC's construct destruction effects) won't recognize that they are the proper card type. &nbsp;Only cards that trigger when \"a card is destroyed\" or \"a ___ card is destroyed\" where that blank is Hero, Villain, or Environment will trigger.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Check the <a href=\"http://www.spiffworld.com/sotm/files/sotm_rules_and_clarifications.pdf\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Savage Mana</a> section.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:02:43.300Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
